OL,3,AAttenborough-backed appeal secures #30m
OL,4,Aestate
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservationists have completed the
OL,7,Fpurchase of a huge upland estate
OL,8,Ffollowing a two-year #30m public appeal
OL,9,Fbacked by the likes of Sir David
OL,10,FAttenborough.
OL,12,FThe Wildlife Trusts - a federation of
OL,13,F47 conservation charities - and
OL,14,FNorthumberland Wildlife Trust (NWT)
OL,15,Fplan to "enhance the rich natural
OL,16,Fheritage" of the Rothbury Estate, a
OL,17,F9,500-acre stretch of former grouse
OL,18,Fmoor, woodland and farmland - having
OL,19,Fheaded off fears it could be split
OL,20,Famong multiple owners.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
