OL,3,AAttenborough-backed appeal secures #30m
OL,4,Aestate
OL,5,
OL,6,FBroadcaster Sir David described it as
OL,7,Fan opportunity "to create something
OL,8,Fvery special for generations to come".
OL,10,FNot everyone supported the campaign,
OL,11,Fthough, with some local farmers having
OL,12,Fwarned the purchase would be "a folly".
